<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>AIditor — Visual Editor for Jay Stack | Jay Framework</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Learn how to use AIditor: live preview, point-and-shoot annotations, Add Menu, video capture, and AI agent integration for Jay Stack projects.">
    <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
    <script type="application/jay-headfull" src="../../components/site-header/site-header" names="SiteHeader" contract="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-contract"></script>
    <script type="application/jay-headfull" src="../../components/site-footer/site-footer" names="SiteFooter" contract="../../components/site-footer/site-footer.jay-contract"></script>
    <script type="application/jay-headless" plugin="@jay-framework/ui-kit" contract="clipboard-copy"></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles/theme.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <style>
      /* ── Page background ── */
      body {
        background: #0e1322;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* ── Shared utilities ── */
      .aid-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding-left: 16px;
        padding-right: 16px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-container {
          padding-left: 32px;
          padding-right: 32px;
        }
      }

      .aid-section {
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-section { padding: 80px 0; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1280px) {
        .aid-section { padding: 96px 0; }
      }

      .aid-section--alt { background: #161b2b; }

      .aid-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-primary-dim);
        letter-spacing: 0.4em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .aid-text-muted { color: #bbc9cf; }

      .aid-glass {
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      }

      /* ── Hero ── */
      .aid-hero {
        position: relative;
        padding: 160px 0 64px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #0e1322;
      }
      .aid-hero-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        opacity: 0.3;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .aid-hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      .aid-hero h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
        line-height: 1.1;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-text);
        max-width: 800px;
      }
      .aid-hero-subhead {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: #bbc9cf;
        max-width: 720px;
      }
      .aid-hero-subhead strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .aid-hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .aid-hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; width: 100%; }
        .aid-hero-buttons > * { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
      }

      .aid-btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 15px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .aid-btn-primary:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .aid-btn-primary:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary-dim);
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }

      .aid-btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.3);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 15px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .aid-btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .aid-btn-secondary:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary-dim);
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }

      /* ── Video frame ── */
      .aid-video-frame {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        border: 1px solid rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.15);
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #05070d;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
      }
      .aid-video-frame:hover {
        border-color: rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.08);
      }
      .aid-video-frame video {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        display: block;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      /* ── Install strip ── */
      .aid-install {
        padding: 24px;
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-install { padding: 32px; }
      }
      .aid-install h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 28px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .aid-install p {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 22px;
        color: #859399;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .aid-code-block {
        background: #05070d;
        border: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 16px 20px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 22px;
        color: #a5e7ff;
        overflow-x: auto;
      }
      .aid-code-block .aid-code-line { white-space: pre; }
      .aid-code-block .aid-code-comment { color: #859399; }
      .aid-install-copy {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 16px;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.25);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s;
      }
      .aid-install-copy:hover { background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.12); }
      .aid-install-copy:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary-dim);
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }
      .aid-copy-icon { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; opacity: 0.7; }
      .aid-install-help {
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 20px;
        color: #859399;
      }
      .aid-install-help code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.08);
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      /* ── Feature section ── */
      .aid-feature-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-feature-header { margin-bottom: 48px; }
      }
      .aid-feature-header h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        line-height: 40px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-top: 12px;
      }
      .aid-feature-header p {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: #bbc9cf;
        max-width: 65ch;
        margin: 16px auto 0;
      }
      .aid-feature-note {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: #bbc9cf;
        max-width: 65ch;
        margin: 32px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-feature-note { margin-top: 48px; }
      }

      /* ── Closing CTA ── */
      .aid-cta {
        position: relative;
        padding: 48px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .aid-cta { padding: 64px 48px; }
      }
      .aid-cta-glow-tl,
      .aid-cta-glow-br {
        position: absolute;
        width: 240px;
        height: 240px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(120px);
        opacity: 0.3;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .aid-cta-glow-tl {
        top: -80px;
        left: -80px;
        background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.5);
      }
      .aid-cta-glow-br {
        bottom: -80px;
        right: -80px;
        background: rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.3);
      }
      .aid-cta h2 {
        position: relative;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
        line-height: 1.2;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      .aid-cta p {
        position: relative;
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: #bbc9cf;
        max-width: 640px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }
      .aid-cta-buttons {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 32px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .aid-cta-buttons { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
        .aid-cta-buttons > * { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .aid-video-frame { transition: none; }
        .aid-video-frame:hover { box-shadow: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="aiditor-intro-root">

      <jay:SiteHeader />

      <main>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- Hero                                        -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-hero">
          <div class="aid-hero-grid"></div>
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-hero-content">
              <span class="aid-label">Visual editor for Jay Stack</span>
              <h1>Edit your site by pointing at it</h1>
              <p class="aid-hero-subhead">
                AIditor is a Jay Stack plugin that runs your project live in the browser.
                Point at any element, describe what you want, and send the request to your
                AI agent — integrated with <strong>Claude Code</strong> today.
              </p>
              <div class="aid-hero-buttons">
                <a class="aid-btn-primary" href="/#cta">Get Started</a>
                <a class="aid-btn-secondary" href="/docs">View documentation</a>
              </div>
              <div class="aid-video-frame" style="margin-top: 32px;">
                <video
                  src="/videos/aiditor-intro/welcome-aiditor.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: AIditor orientation — live preview, top bar, add menu, and agent panel"
                  muted
                  playsinline
                  controls
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="metadata"
                  loading="eager"
                ></video>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- Install strip                               -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-glass aid-install">
              <h2>Install the plugin</h2>
              <p>For developers who want to try AIditor in a Jay project right now.</p>
              <div class="aid-code-block">
                <div class="aid-code-line">yarn add @jay-framework/aiditor</div>
                <div class="aid-code-line">yarn agent-kit</div>
                <div class="aid-code-line">yarn dev</div>
              </div>
              <jay:clipboard-copy text="yarn add @jay-framework/aiditor && yarn agent-kit && yarn dev">
                <button ref="copyBtn" class="aid-install-copy" aria-label="Copy install commands">
                  <span if="!copied">Copy commands</span>
                  <span if="copied">Copied</span>
                  <span if="!copied" class="aid-copy-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                      <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  <span if="copied" class="aid-copy-icon" aria-live="polite">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                </button>
              </jay:clipboard-copy>
              <p class="aid-install-help">
                Then open <code>/aiditor</code> in the browser. AIditor does not ship an agent —
                it connects to the agent you already use (<strong>Claude Code</strong> via
                <code>claude login</code> or <code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code>).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 1. What is AIditor?                          -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">01 · Welcome</span>
              <h2>What is AIditor?</h2>
              <p>
                AIditor is the visual editor for Jay Stack. Open your project, preview any
                page live, annotate on the canvas, and send change requests to your AI agent.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/welcome-aiditor.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: What is AIditor — orientation tour"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 2. Live preview                             -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">02 · Live preview</span>
              <h2>Every page, live in the editor</h2>
              <p>
                Your whole project runs inside AIditor. Switch routes from the Pages panel —
                what you see is the real site, not a mockup.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/live-preview-pages.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: switching routes in the live preview"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 3. Point and shoot                          -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">03 · Point &amp; shoot</span>
              <h2>Point and shoot</h2>
              <p>
                Click what you want to change and write a short instruction. AIditor captures
                context and screenshots so your agent knows exactly what you mean.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/change-request-1.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: point and shoot annotation — placing the first pin comment"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 4. Stack multiple comments                  -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">04 · Multi-pin</span>
              <h2>Add more pins before you send</h2>
              <p>
                Keep annotating — place another pin on a different element and write a second
                instruction. AIditor collects every marker so you can send several changes in
                one request.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/change-request-2.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: stacking multiple pin comments before sending"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 5. Send to your agent                       -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">05 · Send to agent</span>
              <h2>Send to your agent</h2>
              <p>
                When your annotations are ready, send them all at once. Your agent reads every
                marker, screenshot, and instruction — then implements the changes in code.
                Watch the preview update when the agent finishes.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/send-to-agent.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: sending annotations to the AI agent and viewing the result"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 6. Add Menu — drag from the catalog         -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">06 · Add menu</span>
              <h2>Drag from the catalog</h2>
              <p>
                The <strong>+ Add</strong> menu lists ready-made change requests packaged by
                Jay plugins integrated with AIditor — each item is an instruction for your agent.
                Drag one onto the page to start a request.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/add-menu-request.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: dragging a change request from the Add Menu onto the page"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 7. Add Menu — @ mentions                    -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">07 · @ mentions</span>
              <h2>Autocomplete with @</h2>
              <p>
                Type <code style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary);">@</code>
                in any instruction to open autocomplete. It lists every <strong>+ Add</strong> menu item
                and more — non-visual references plugins choose to expose, like e-commerce categories
                or page routes. When you select an item, your agent gets ready-made change context
                for that choice; behind the scenes, the request can point the agent to the right
                skills and implementation guidance.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/auto-complete.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: @ autocomplete for Add Menu items, routes, and plugin context"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 8. Record interactions                      -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">08 · Recording</span>
              <h2>Capture motion and hover states</h2>
              <p>
                Hover states, motion, and animations do not show up in a still screenshot.
                Hit <strong>REC</strong>, interact with the page, then pin and annotate the
                moments that matter.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/capture-video.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: recording page interactions with the REC button"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- 9. Comment on a recording + send to agent   -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-feature-header">
              <span class="aid-label">09 · Recording · agent · result</span>
              <h2>From recording to implementation</h2>
              <p>
                Scrub the timeline, add pins at key frames, and leave notes at any timestamp.
                Send the recording with your annotations — your agent reads the video plus
                context at every moment you mark, implements the change, and the preview
                updates with the result.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-video-frame">
              <video
                src="/videos/aiditor-intro/video-preview-commenting-agent.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: commenting on a video capture, sending to the agent, and seeing the applied result"
                muted
                playsinline
                controls
                loop
                preload="metadata"
                loading="lazy"
              ></video>
            </div>
            <p class="aid-feature-note">
              Recording is also ideal when you want to review multi-page flows or complex
              application scenarios. Capture a longer session, scrub to the keyframes that
              matter, and annotate each moment before you send.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <!-- Closing CTA                                 -->
        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
        <section class="aid-section">
          <div class="aid-container">
            <div class="aid-glass aid-cta">
              <div class="aid-cta-glow-tl"></div>
              <div class="aid-cta-glow-br"></div>
              <h2>Start building with AIditor</h2>
              <p>
                Install the plugin in any Jay project, run the dev server, and open
                <code style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary);">/aiditor</code>.
                Your agent does the coding — you point and describe.
              </p>
              <div class="aid-cta-buttons">
                <a class="aid-btn-primary" href="/#cta">Get Started</a>
                <a class="aid-btn-secondary" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
                <a class="aid-btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </main>

      <jay:SiteFooter />

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
